TODO ****************************************************************************************************
    -------------------------------- Limits to know about------------------------------------------------
    - Doubles tournaments get fixtures and slots,
        but Match_Service only creates frames for singles and team matches,
        so doubles can't be scored through slots yet.
    - Team tournaments get slots, and you assign players per slot with the existing endpoints.
    - Ties in standings break on wins, then name. There's no head-to-head or frame difference yet.
    - Match_Controller still has no exception handlers,
        so the new "slot already has a frame" error would show as a 500 until you add handlers there.
        A single @RestControllerAdvice would fix that everywhere.